This plugin is derived from Omarchy (https://omarchy.org/),
Copyright (c) 2024 Omarchy contributors, and is used under the same MIT
license. See the upstream sources for the authoritative history:

  Bar.qml                       $OMARCHY_PATH/shell/plugins/bar/Bar.qml
  BarModel.js                   $OMARCHY_PATH/shell/plugins/bar/BarModel.js

Everything in those two files is upstream's, except where a comment says
`nagualcode.toptop`. Those comments mark every change made here, so the diff
against a fresh upstream copy stays readable:

  git diff --no-index \
    "$OMARCHY_PATH/shell/plugins/bar/Bar.qml" Bar.qml

is the whole story.